    <comment>- update to 1.3.0:
  * Summary: Preserve raw data and auto behaviour
  * Enhance k-fold cross-validation with random seed and
    pointwise handling
  * Add moment matching arg to main `loo()` function
  * Update Code of Conduct
  * Fix typos, grammar, and deprecated links in README and
    diagnostics</comment>
